:{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。木耳、银耳吃多少泡多少，剩下的倒掉。湿米粉只买当天吃得完的量。难在泡多了舍不得倒，有些人家习惯自己做酸汤子。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国食源性疾病暴发监测里，2010 到 2020 年共报告米酵菌酸中毒 19 起。发病 146 人，死亡 43 人，病死率 29.5%（指发病的人里有 29.5% 死亡）。按吃的东西分：自家发酵的玉米面制品 9 起，死 33 人。湿米粉 5 起，死 7 人。木耳 3 起，5 人发病，死 3 人。2020 年全国食物中毒报告死亡 143 人，米酵菌酸占 12 人。排在它前面的是毒蘑菇（80 人）和甲醇（14 人）。北京市市场监管局的提示写明：米酵菌酸 100℃ 煮沸、高压锅蒸煮都破坏不了，目前没有特效解毒药。广东 2018 年起要求湿米粉小包装密封、标清保质期。前后对比，全省每年的病例数从平均 6.25 例降到 0.5 例"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Zhang H 等 (2023). Epidemiology of foodborne bongkrekic acid poisoning outbreaks in China, 2010 to 2020. PLoS One 18(1):e0279957：「From 2010–2020, a total of 19 BA poisoning outbreaks were reported to the China National Foodborne Disease Outbreak Surveillance System. These outbreaks involved 146 illnesses, 139 hospitalizations, and 43 deaths, with a case-fatality rate of 29.5%.」",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0279957","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0279957"]}," ; Li H 等 (2021). Characteristics of Settings and Etiologic Agents of Foodborne Disease Outbreaks — China, 2020. China CDC Weekly 3(42):889-893. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.46234/ccdcw2021.219","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.46234/ccdcw2021.219"]}," ; Yuan Y 等 (2020). A Foodborne Bongkrekic Acid Poisoning Incident — Heilongjiang Province, 2020. China CDC Weekly 2(51):975-978：「In October 2020, 9 persons in Jidong County, Heilongjiang Province died after consuming a homemade fermented corn flour product — sour soup — with a case fatality rate of 100%.」",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.46234/ccdcw2020.264","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.46234/ccdcw2020.264"]}," ; Liu Z 等 (2026). Controlling the Storage Time Is an Effective Measure to Reduce the Risk of Bongkrekic Acid Poisoning Caused by Wet Rice Noodles. Foodborne Pathog Dis 23(7):468-472（2025-05-12 网络首发）：「The annual average number of BKA poisoning cases in Guangdong Province dropped from 6.25 before implementing the code to 0.5 after implementing the code.」",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1089/fpd.2024.0131","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1089/fpd.2024.0131"]}," ; 北京市市场监督管理局 (2023). 关于米酵菌酸引发食物中毒的风险提示：「米酵菌酸对热稳定，经100℃煮沸和高压烹饪也不能被破坏」「目前，尚无米酵菌酸特效解毒药物」「隔天泡制的银耳、木耳及其加工制品不能食用」「耳片不成形、发粘、无弹性或有异臭味的不能食用」「尽快催吐，排出胃内容物，减少毒素的吸收量；及时送医院救治」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/hdjl/xfts/202309/t20230904_3248296.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/hdjl/xfts/202309/t20230904_3248296.html"]}," ; 湖南省市场监督管理局 (2025). 【食安科普】米酵菌酸致命警告：「银耳冷水（室温）浸泡3~4小时，木耳冷水浸泡1~2小时，中途换水1~2次，去除微生物，泡发时长最长均不能超过8小时」「若浸泡后银耳、木耳摸起来黏黏的，弹性差，有酸臭异味，泡发水浑浊，是变质的表现，应立即丢弃」「当中毒发生时，应第一时间催吐，减少毒素的吸收；尽量保存可疑的致病食物，并及时就医」「吃了同样食物的人，不管有没有症状，都应送医院检查」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://amr.hunan.gov.cn/amr/xxx/xtdtx/202506/t20250630_33725786.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://amr.hunan.gov.cn/amr/xxx/xtdtx/202506/t20250630_33725786.html"]}," ; 贵州省市场监督管理局 (2023). 关于谨防米酵菌酸中毒的食品安全警示：「选购银耳、木耳等相关食品时，要选择正规渠道，泡发不可过夜，应及时加工食用」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://amr.guizhou.gov.cn/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/tzgg_5626971/tzgg_5626972/202307/t20230728_81318622.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://amr.guizhou.gov.cn/zfxxgk/fdzdgknr/tzgg_5626971/tzgg_5626972/202307/t20230728_81318622.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["2020 年 10 月，黑龙江鸡西市鸡东县几家人早饭吃了自制的酸汤子。吃了的 9 个人全部死亡。木耳冷水泡一两个小时就够，泡发时间各地写法不一，湖南写最长不超过 8 小时。耳片发黏、没弹性、有酸臭味，或者泡发水浑浊，整盆倒掉。吃完出现呕吐、头晕、浑身没劲，马上催吐，带上剩下的食物去医院。一起吃的人没症状也要去查。野生蘑菇见第 5 条（不吃野生蘑菇）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/01-47"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"45 岁以上，住在胃癌食管癌高发地区、有家族史或幽门螺杆菌阳性的，去做胃镜筛查"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/01-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["装烟雾报警器；冬天在室内烧煤、用燃气取暖的再装一氧化碳报警器"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一个能正常工作的烟雾报警器，能把住宅火灾里死亡的概率降约六成。美国死了人的住宅火灾，四成起火时人在睡觉。冬天在屋里烧煤或用燃气的，再加一个一氧化碳报警器。中国…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/01-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["燃气软管和灶具到期就换，不自己改管道，燃气公司上门推销可以直接拒绝"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["软管和灶具到期就换，这是《城镇燃气管理条例》写明的用户义务。自己改管道、拆燃气表是条例明令禁止的。同一部条例还写了，燃气公司不能要求你买它指定的产品和服务。上门…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/01-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不采、不买、不吃野生蘑菇，任何「土办法鉴别」都不成立"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["光 2025 年一年，中国疾控中心就调查了 828 起蘑菇中毒，2165 人中招，13 人死。那一年还新认出 34 种以前没记录过会毒人的蘑菇。银针试毒、虫子吃…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/01-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["电动自行车不推进楼道、不进电梯、不在家里充电"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["在高层住宅的门厅、走道、楼梯间停电动车或者充电，是应急管理部的规章明令禁止的。不改正的，个人罚 500 到 1000 元，做生意的罚 2000 到 10000…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/01-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["量血压，高了就吃药降到达标"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["高压每降 10 mmHg，出大的心血管毛病的概率降两成，中风降 27%。心衰降 28%，死亡概率降 13%。中国 35 到 75 岁的人里，44.7% 有高血压…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/01-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["35 岁以后只要超重，就去查一次空腹血糖，正常也每三年再查"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["花几十块抽一管血，就能在一点症状都没有的时候查出糖尿病前期。美国官方的筛查建议是：35 到 70 岁、超重或肥胖的人去查。查出来正常的，每三年再查一次。美国按体…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tex